{"version":1,"key":"card:410","content":{"id":410,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e8e11e3-95ca-4e6e-83e2-0b415014b47b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果输入与输出有相同的生命周期标识，则表示输入必须活的比输出长，换句话说输出的生命的周期要小于该输入，否则如果输入先死，输出引用了输入，输出引用了一个死掉的数据，是不行的，所以输出的生命周期一定比输入短。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"256f479c-8133-48fa-9566-3be2c7faa3d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际的生命周期由输入决定，并且是由生命周期最短的决定"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Rust","uuid":"041967e4-42f4-4c8b-ac7c-3e82a9d9af94","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e5fc91f2-1e06-421d-a553-d7e720b76c1c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn max<'a'>(x: &'a i32, y: &'a i32) -> '&a i32 {\n  \n}","collabId":"8fda5551-ef2a-42a4-b292-e39be0ec3b83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac417bcd-7b44-45f7-b0e8-e7c54d63f4b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"'a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的生命周期由 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 最短的那个决定，返回值的生命周期一定是短于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"646719b4-cb49-49c4-b35b-ef8e27b9a799","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果结构体中的字段是引用，假设该引用的生命周期是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"'a"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么结构体的生命周期一定要小于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"'a"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则引用失效了，结构体还活着，通过该引用访问的是无效的数据，这是不被允许的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6b1c5eb-51c0-4e8d-8df8-f5c924ae48d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以类比于函数，将结构体看作是函数的输出，将其中的引用字段看作是函数的输入，可以有多个输入，其结构体的生命周期一定要短于其中所有引用字段的生命周期，以保证访问到的数据是有效的。"}]}],"tags":["Rust/生命周期"],"createTime":1709219361718,"updateTime":1755938868497,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938868497}}